        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "136. All temporary transfers or promotions to a higher classified position within the same geographical area (Area I or II), shall be paid for the shift at the higher rate of pay (that step in the higher classification which provides a minimum increase of $0.15 per hour) provided that the employee completes four (4) hours in the assignment.",
